# ::tok In the first week after the Spring Festival in 2023, both the number of jobs prioritizing returnees and the number of returnees seeking jobs in China showed an upward trend. The number of jobs prioritizing returnees increased by 11% on February 3 compared to January 28, and the number of returnees seeking jobs increased by 27%.
