# ::tok The report suggests that the content ecosystem in the e-commerce industry is a comprehensive concept that integrates e-commerce with content. However, not all content can be integrated with e-commerce. Good PGC (Professionally Generated Content) and UGC (User Generated Content) are the high-quality carriers for integration with e-commerce. The higher the value of the content platform, the richer the scenarios for consumption and promotion, the higher the possibility of e-commerce implantation, and the stronger the commercial value. The proportion of e-commerce content production and content consumption in this gradually integrated public and private domain will also be higher.
