# ::tok The delegation visited the World Heritage Site "Historic Centre of Macau", experienced the Macau Grand Prix Museum, "Time Travel. Tour of St. Paul's" - St. Paul's Ruins immersive digital experience exhibition, Macau Product Collection, the old city of Taipa, and several large resorts and facilities such as Grand Lisboa, The Karl Lagerfeld, Wynn Palace, MGM Cotai, Morpheus, The Londoner Macao, Galaxy Macau, Artelli multidimensional art space of City of Dreams and teamLab SuperNature of The Venetian Macao, in groups over the past two days.
