# ::tok The latest statistics released by the Singapore Tourism Board show that the number of inbound tourists in 2022 increased 19 times from 330,600 in 2021 to 6.3 million, surpassing the board's earlier estimate of 4 to 6 million. Tourism has now recovered to 33% of pre-pandemic levels.
