# ::tok From January to September 2022, Singapore's tourism revenue totaled 8.96 billion Singapore dollars. It is estimated that the total tourism revenue for 2022 can reach 13.8 to 14.3 billion Singapore dollars, an increase of 6 to 7 times compared to 1.89 billion Singapore dollars in 2021, and has recovered to about 50% to 52% of the level before the COVID-19 pandemic in 2019.
