# ::tok This was my first time shopping on Amazon, and I had several impressions. Let's start with my experience after using the product. Firstly, it was indeed painless and there was no irritating smell, overall it was quite good. After waiting for about 8 minutes, the hair came off easily, although there were a few small hair residues left, which were not noticeable unless you looked closely. So overall, it was good. As for the future, I will need to continue observing and using it to know more.
