# ::tok When I received it, the condition of the sealing tape looked very wrong, as if it had been opened. I quickly took a picture, and sure enough, it opened as soon as I tore it. After opening it, the cardboard inside was also damaged. I was worried that it was returned by someone else, so I hurriedly tried it on my husband before the anniversary. As a result, the machine had no power at all, but luckily there were no stubble in the blade, otherwise how would I return it from such a distance!
